  m_Name: Ingrid Dialogue
  m_EditorClassIdentifier: 
  contactName: Ingrid
  dialogueLines:
  - Wow you finally set up the fish shop you always talked about. I like it. It's
    quaint.
  - Do you have anything that sparkles?
  - This one is SO CUTE! I have to have it.
  - "Just got back from clinicals. I thought I\u2019d swing by and show my support!"
  - Mallory is gonna freak when I show her this.
  - "You\u2019re here like all the time. Do you even have time to study??"
